msgid ""
"A Nibe F-series pump sends up to 20 registers listed in a LOG.SET file by"
" itself, twice a second, so Thermaestro needn't ask for them one at a "
"time. Copy the file to a USB stick and load it in the pump's USB menu "
"(7.2). The pump is particular about sticks: those larger than 4 GB, or "
"made in about the last 15 years, often aren't accepted. Everything works "
"without it, more slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A simple thermostat cuts the room off at its own setting. Where "
"Thermaestro steers the room, turn the thermostat up to its highest "
"setting, so it doesn't stop the room before Thermaestro's band is "
"reached."
msgstr ""

